  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, and Xayah. Version 0.9.0 replaces Dancer (dancer, official 007) with a three-skill Q/E/R Xayah whose double feathers, Clean Cuts attacks, tiered Bladecaller recall, and Featherstorm are built on auditable data-layer state. It also fixes seeded elemental drakes so the rendered model and objective name consume the same per-match selection. Includes ImageGen actor, VFX, icons, Ban/Pick art, full-body encyclopedia art, Rift quality assets, and pinned official ability audio. Built for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
